{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "aec54526-108e-8c29-9bf8-be9f732c591f",
  "created_at": "2026-01-07T14:40:48-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marisol Castillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T14:39:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T14:39:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Tony. I have three things. First, I want to change the mailing address on a water and sewer account. Second, I want to go paperless. And third, I want to ask about paying at night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T14:39:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, we can do those. What's the service address on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T14:39:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 359 Pelham Street. But the account is not in my name. It's in my husband's name. He passed, so it's still under him. Is that a problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T14:39:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not a problem for the call. Changing the name on the account is a separate step, but I can note the mailing address. Where should the bills go now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T14:39:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, first, I do not understand why it would still be his name if I pay it. Second, the new mailing address is a P.O. box. Wait, should I say that now or after the paperless part?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T14:39:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Now is fine. Go ahead with the box."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T14:39:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Sorry, my cat, no, the neighbor's cat, sits on my windowsill every afternoon and it just knocked something over. Okay. The box, I have to find the number. Can I call back with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T14:40:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Same with paperless, we'll need an email for that, so have both ready. Anything else I can answer now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T14:40:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the third thing. Is there a phone line where I can pay at night, when City Hall is closed? Like a number I call and enter things?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T14:40:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is an automated payment option by phone, and you can also pay online any hour. The drop box works too. When you call back with the box number, I can give you the phone line details."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T14:40:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the phone line is automated, and online is any time, and the drop box is the third. Okay. But does the bill have to be in my name first, or can I pay under his?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T14:40:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can pay under his name. Just use the account number from the bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T14:40:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I think so. Thank you, Tony. I will call back."
    }
  ],
